@startuml state-wallet
!include style.iuml
hide empty description
skinparam stateFontStyle bold
skinparam stateAttributeFontSize 10
skinparam stateAttributeFontStyle plain
skinparam ArrowFontSize 10
title wallet machine (WalletLifecycle.tla), generated from model/transitions.json: 56 rows, 9 states

legend top left
Guard atoms and their domains
  kc_up in {False, True}
  item in {"empty", "ours", "other"}
  cap_host in {False, True}
  cap_fresh in {False, True}
  pasted_derives in {False, True}
  funds in {False, True}
  inflight in {False, True}
  address_disclosed in {False, True}
  has_code in {False, True}
  saved in {False, True}
  version_current in {False, True}
Definitions
  removable = (not funds) and (not inflight) and (saved or not address_disclosed)
Label: event [guard] / TLA+ action (conflicts.md rules)
Lines inside a state answer the event without a state change.
endlegend

state "none" as wallet_none
state "creating" as wallet_creating
state "ready_unsaved" as wallet_ready_unsaved
state "ready_saved" as wallet_ready_saved
state "ready_skipped" as wallet_ready_skipped
state "archived" as wallet_archived
state "removing" as wallet_removing
state "removed" as wallet_removed <<terminal>>
state "dropped" as wallet_dropped <<terminal>>

[*] --> wallet_none
wallet_removed --> [*]
wallet_dropped --> [*]

' row 1
wallet_creating : keychain_write [kc_up and item == 'empty'] / Write (C15,C20)
' row 3
wallet_creating : keychain_write [not kc_up] / AbortCreate (C20)
' row 6
wallet_creating : read_back [not kc_up] / AbortCreate (C20)
' row 9
wallet_creating : restart [not kc_up] / Reconcile (C15,C20)
' row 10
wallet_ready_unsaved : reveal [cap_host and cap_fresh and kc_up and item == 'ours'] / Reveal (C14,C16)
' row 13
